# Secrets — never commit
.env

# Data
# The roster: 124 real minors' LRNs, parent names, mobile numbers and emails.
# Sensitive personal information under RA 10173. It was tracked once by accident
# (this line was commented out) and reached a public GitHub repo; the history has
# since been rewritten to remove it. It must stay in the working tree -- seed_demo.py
# reads it -- but it must never be committed again.
student-info.xlsx

# Register exports. The Export dialog defaults to the repo root, and accepting that
# default once put a file of real student names into a commit.
attendance-*.xlsx
trackify-analytics-*.xlsx

*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
data/
backups/
media/photos/

